  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Krypkasino. Logic: Avoidance fishing game. Key: Forced capture, avoid penalty cards, Tabbe = -1 point.',
    Player: 'Krypkasino is a Swedish avoidance version of Casino. Try to avoid capturing cards, especially penalty cards (10 Diamonds=2pts, 2 Spades=1pt, Aces=1pt). Forced capture rule: if you can capture, you must. Clearing the table (Tabbe) gives -1 point.',
    objective: 'Score as few points as possible. The round ends when a player hits 13 or 21 penalty points.',
    gameplay: "1. **Forced Capture**: If you hold a card that CAN capture a card or sum from the table, you MUST capture it. You cannot choose to discard if a capture is possible.\n2. **Building**: You can 'build' onto table cards to avoid a current capture, but you must be able to capture the build yourself on a future turn.\n3. **Table Clearing (Tabbe)**: Clearing the table is worth -1 point (a good thing in misere).",
    keyRules: [
      'Forced capture rule: must capture if possible',
      '10 of Diamonds (Storan) = 2 penalty points',
      '2 of Spades (Lillan) = 1 penalty point',
      'Each Ace = 1 penalty point',
      'Most Cards = 1 penalty point',
      'Most Spades = 1 penalty point',
      'Tabbe (clearing table) = -1 point',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: '2 to 4 players individually.',
      deck: 'Standard 52-card deck. **Special Capture Values**: 10 of Diamonds = 16, 2 of Spades = 15, Aces = 14 or 1.',
      equipment: 'Standard 52-card deck. **Special Capture Values**: 10 of Diamonds = 16, 2 of Spades = 15, Aces = 14 or 1.',
      dealing: 'Each player receives 4 cards; 4 cards are placed face-up on the table. The rest form a draw pile.',
    },
    turnFlow: "1. **Forced Capture**: If you hold a card that CAN capture a card or sum from the table, you MUST capture it. You cannot choose to discard if a capture is possible.\n2. **Building**: You can 'build' onto table cards to avoid a current capture, but you must be able to capture the build yourself on a future turn.\n3. **Table Clearing (Tabbe)**: Clearing the table is worth -1 point (a good thing in misere).",
